<title>UK: World Bank sets 100 mln mark three-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 100 mln mark three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank International Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    09.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.30    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.075     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUE WILL ACCRUE INTEREST ONLY FOR THOSE DAYS WHEN</p>
<p>THE THREE-YEAR SWAP RATE IS BELOW 5.50 PERCENT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
